{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"pike","model_identifier":"pike","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## pike\n\nPolearm, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 256x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -0.9..0.9, z -129.0..7.5 (size 1.8 x 1.8 x 136.5 u = 5 x 5 x 384 cm).\nSteel pike, about 3.6 m (136.5 u): long ash shaft, small steel point with steel langets running 12 u down the shaft, iron butt cap and a team-colour tassel ring below the langets. Grip (rear hand) at the origin, 7.5 u from the butt; point 129 u forward (-Z). **Second grip 11.5 u forward** (warrior_base polearm clips; a wider pike stance can slide it to ~20 u). Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `pike_steel.png`, `pike_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## pike\n\nPolearm, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 256x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -0.9..0.9, z -129.0..7.5 (size 1.8 x 1.8 x 136.5 u = 5 x 5 x 384 cm).\nSteel pike, about 3.6 m (136.5 u): long ash shaft, small steel point with steel langets running 12 u down the shaft, iron butt cap and a team-colour tassel ring below the langets. Grip (rear hand) at the origin, 7.5 u from the butt; point 129 u forward (-Z). **Second grip 11.5 u forward** (warrior_base polearm clips; a wider pike stance can slide it to ~20 u). Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `pike_steel.png`, `pike_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.5,-118.0],"to":[0.5,0.5,6.0],"autouv":0,